{"version":3,"kind":"Article","sha256":"1250a2aa233c4f9d27f3e9d945b3ccb1f3f2b8cbe9f7b8f9a1c942431a16b882","slug":"seismology.seismic-wave","location":"/seismology/seismic-wave.md","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"地震波","content_includes_title":false,"license":{"content":{"id":"CC-BY-NC-4.0","url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/","name":"Creative Commons Attribution Non Commercial 4.0 International","CC":true}},"github":"https://github.com/seismo-learn/seismology101","numbering":{"title":{"offset":1}},"source_url":"https://github.com/seismo-learn/seismology101/blob/main/source/seismology/seismic-wave.md","edit_url":"https://github.com/seismo-learn/seismology101/edit/main/source/seismology/seismic-wave.md","thumbnail":"/seismology101/_public/body-wave-propagatio-a041890a732f856d5505efa98d9db172.jpg","exports":[{"format":"md","filename":"seismic-wave.md","url":"/seismology101/_public/seismic-wave-3bcfaafd096f91e203a9013bfec3c775.md"}]},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","children":[{"type":"div","class":"page-meta","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"span","class":"page-meta-item","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✍️ 姚家园、田冬冬","key":"XmHmPw7GVW"}],"key":"Ju3kkEqK5E"},{"type":"span","class":"page-meta-item","children":[{"type":"text","value":"📅 2022-11-12","key":"xgUMR9NtWG"}],"key":"JDOeDaKpDQ"},{"type":"span","class":"page-meta-item","children":[{"type":"text","value":"⏱️ 20 分钟","key":"ZVdglBLgus"}],"key":"XwLbZY3ilI"}],"key":"EUsoYX8pZw"}],"key":"tWbgBYzI9w"},{"type":"thematicBreak","key":"mJQA2Bi7uA"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":12,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"震源激发的机械振动以地震波的形式在地球内部传播。地震波分为体波（body wave）\n和面波（surface wave）两种类型。体波是指在地球内部传播的波，而面波是指在地球表面\n附近传播的波。本节将介绍最基础的地震波理论。","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"key":"hKjOPljP3H"}],"key":"rXs704wOt3"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":14,"column":1},"end":{"line":14,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"体波","position":{"start":{"line":14,"column":1},"end":{"line":14,"column":1}},"key":"lrYASKAUvi"}],"identifier":"id","label":"体波","html_id":"id","implicit":true,"key":"CII9n3GgMd"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"体波分为 P 波（P-wave）和 S 波（S-wave）两种。","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"key":"mgt9Kh4Ik0"}],"key":"pUUJ1glCgH"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":19,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"从传播速度的角度看，P 波比 S 波传播速度快。因而 P 波总是最先到达观测者所在的位置，\nS 波则在 P 波后到达。因而，P 波和 S 波也分别被称为 ","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"key":"r1HGYkravf"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"p","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"key":"AQUMlcrTTj"}],"key":"JjZWftoQTH"},{"type":"text","value":"rimary wave 和 ","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"key":"X9RMZp3Agf"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"s","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"key":"S1NiWyixYl"}],"key":"M4gzS72OTG"},{"type":"text","value":"econdary wave。","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"key":"skzGXoejDQ"}],"key":"tHoxTyFvDV"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":25,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"从物理属性上来说，P 波是一种纵波（longitudinal wave），P 波在介质中传播时，介质的\n运动方向与波传播的方向相同或相反，介质交替压缩和膨胀导致介质的体积发生变化（如下图所示），\n因而 P 波也称为压缩波（com","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"key":"oH64s82yG1"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"p","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"key":"Jxu8Ieob8p"}],"key":"rmOxiPrqY1"},{"type":"text","value":"ressional wave）。S 波是一种横波（transverse wave），\nS 波在介质中传播时，介质的运动方向与波传播的方向垂直，会造成介质的剪切变形，但\n不改变介质的体积（如下图示），因而 S 波也称为剪切波（","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"key":"lWXnOUL0mZ"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"s","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"key":"ZNqXHxj3Fz"}],"key":"ub1zHFjVQ7"},{"type":"text","value":"hear wave）。","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"key":"IFA6P72fSV"}],"key":"Liqzvbe6HK"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":29,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"事实上，地震学家首先根据波到达的先后顺序将两种波命名为 primary wave 和 secondary wave，\n并简称为 P-wave 和 S-wave，最后在进一步理解了两种地震波的物理属性后，才分别\n将其称为 com","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"key":"jOtKsG4HxD"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"p","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"key":"aRkBn5gFwM"}],"key":"ayAWorx9cD"},{"type":"text","value":"ressional wave 和 ","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"key":"eo1XtqWgeD"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"s","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"key":"PwIdqtGyOJ"}],"key":"zWeresiaM4"},{"type":"text","value":"hear wave。","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"key":"ov6KuRQCUB"}],"key":"FO49i3gVzx"},{"type":"container","kind":"figure","children":[{"type":"image","url":"/seismology101/_public/body-wave-propagatio-a041890a732f856d5505efa98d9db172.jpg","alt":"\"体波的介质运动方向以及波传播方向\"","width":"80%","align":"center","key":"f7AQA3VgON","urlSource":"body-wave-propagation.jpg"},{"type":"caption","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":36,"column":1},"end":{"line":36,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"体波的介质运动方向以及波传播方向。引自《","position":{"start":{"line":36,"column":1},"end":{"line":36,"column":1}},"key":"W1yTSaUMFR"},{"type":"link","url":"https://www.cambridge.org/us/academic/subjects/earth-and-environmental-science/solid-earth-geophysics/introduction-seismology-3rd-edition?format=HB&isbn=9781316635742","position":{"start":{"line":36,"column":1},"end":{"line":36,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Introduction to Seismology","position":{"start":{"line":36,"column":1},"end":{"line":36,"column":1}},"key":"x8YsAY2u28"}],"urlSource":"https://www.cambridge.org/us/academic/subjects/earth-and-environmental-science/solid-earth-geophysics/introduction-seismology-3rd-edition?format=HB&isbn=9781316635742","key":"n4PnGEjpx3"},{"type":"text","value":"》（第三版）图 3.2。","position":{"start":{"line":36,"column":1},"end":{"line":36,"column":1}},"key":"knuMCBXDWb"}],"key":"vjMyNMvHvW"}],"key":"PiulsAExJU"}],"enumerator":"1","key":"SkLOzJK4kl"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":39,"column":1},"end":{"line":39,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"面波","position":{"start":{"line":39,"column":1},"end":{"line":39,"column":1}},"key":"Q0jP85li0U"}],"identifier":"id","label":"面波","html_id":"id-1","implicit":true,"key":"u3hTUHb8lz"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":41,"column":1},"end":{"line":44,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"沿着地球表面附近传播的面波也有两种，即瑞利波（Rayleigh wave）和勒夫波（Love wave）。\nRayleigh 波在地表传播时，介质的运动既有与波传播方向相同或相反的分量，又有与波传播方向垂直\n的分量（如下图示）。Love 波在地表传播时，介质的运动方向与波传播方向垂直（如下图示）。\n面波的振幅随着深度增加会剧烈减少。","position":{"start":{"line":41,"column":1},"end":{"line":41,"column":1}},"key":"zqNyUljOpp"}],"key":"d70WRPDtx8"},{"type":"container","kind":"figure","children":[{"type":"image","url":"/seismology101/_public/surface-wave-propaga-c1937e31234bb098827aadccac633178.jpg","alt":"\"面波的介质运动方向以及波传播方向\"","width":"50%","align":"center","key":"inuWs9JYCJ","urlSource":"surface-wave-propagation.jpg"},{"type":"caption","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":51,"column":1},"end":{"line":52,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"基阶 Love 波（上）和 Rayleigh 波（下）的介质运动方向（假设面波沿着页面从左向右传播）。\n引自《","position":{"start":{"line":51,"column":1},"end":{"line":51,"column":1}},"key":"pga3sMVHUv"},{"type":"link","url":"https://www.cambridge.org/us/academic/subjects/earth-and-environmental-science/solid-earth-geophysics/introduction-seismology-3rd-edition?format=HB&isbn=9781316635742","position":{"start":{"line":51,"column":1},"end":{"line":51,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Introduction to Seismology","position":{"start":{"line":51,"column":1},"end":{"line":51,"column":1}},"key":"udpN6C7g3U"}],"urlSource":"https://www.cambridge.org/us/academic/subjects/earth-and-environmental-science/solid-earth-geophysics/introduction-seismology-3rd-edition?format=HB&isbn=9781316635742","key":"uZucHyxUXF"},{"type":"text","value":"》（第三版）图 8.5。","position":{"start":{"line":51,"column":1},"end":{"line":51,"column":1}},"key":"B8Aei5va7w"}],"key":"eVPLmYM9eC"}],"key":"en3Ui5gtuz"}],"enumerator":"2","key":"wOpv4awQ6T"}],"key":"LUr4qNqQVQ"}],"key":"xTSKxLn8ZT"},"references":{"cite":{"order":[],"data":{}}},"footer":{"navigation":{"prev":{"title":"震源","url":"/seismology/seismic-source","group":"地震学基础"},"next":{"title":"地震震相","url":"/seismology/seismic-phase","group":"地震学基础"}}},"domain":"http://pre.render"}